## 1. Overview Produk

### Apa itu Matterhorn.co?

**Matterhorn.co** adalah platform web untuk **jasa penyewaan alat outdoor/camping**. User bisa browse katalog produk, pilih tanggal sewa, checkout online, lalu **mengambil dan mengembalikan barang di toko fisik**.

### Model Bisnis

```
┌────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│              ALUR SEWA MATTERHORN              │
│                                                │
│  1. User browse katalog alat camping di web    │
│  2. User pilih produk + tanggal mulai/selesai  │
│  3. User tambah ke cart                        │
│  4. User checkout (harus punya alamat/profil)  │
│  5. User bayar (transfer / payment gateway)    │
│  6. Admin approve pesanan                      │
│  7. User AMBIL barang DI TOKO (in-store)       │
│  8. User KEMBALIKAN barang DI TOKO             │
│  9. Admin cek kondisi & selesaikan rental      │
└────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

### Mengapa Alamat Bukan untuk Delivery?

Alamat user berfungsi sebagai **verifikasi identitas & keamanan** — bukan alamat pengiriman. Jika barang tidak dikembalikan, alamat jadi referensi. Checkout **diblokir** jika user belum set alamat.

### Key Features

| Feature | Description |
|---------|-------------|
| 🏕️ **Katalog Produk** | Browse alat camping dengan foto, deskripsi, harga/hari |
| 📅 **Rental Calendar** | Pilih tanggal mulai & selesai sewa |
| 🛒 **Cart System** | Persistent cart, multi-item |
| ✅ **Checkout** | Validasi alamat, validasi jam buka toko |
| 💰 **Payment** | Transfer bank / payment gateway |
| 👤 **User Profile** | Nama, alamat, riwayat sewa |
| 🔧 **Admin Panel** | Kelola produk, pesanan, stok, user |
| 📊 **Dashboard Admin** | Analytics: pendapatan, produk populer, stock level |

---

## 2. Tech Stack

### Definitive Stack

| Layer | Technology | Version | Purpose |
|-------|-----------|---------|---------|
| **Frontend** | Next.js (App Router) | 15.x | SSR, routing, React framework |
| **Frontend Language** | TypeScript | 5.x | Type safety |
| **CSS** | Tailwind CSS | 3.x / 4.x | Utility-first styling |
| **State Management** | Zustand | latest | Client-side state (cart, auth) |
| **Backend** | Laravel | 11.x | REST API, business logic |
| **Backend Language** | PHP | 8.2+ | Server language |
| **Authentication** | Laravel Sanctum | built-in | Token-based API auth |
| **Database** | MySQL | 8.x | Primary data store |
| **Validation** | Laravel Form Requests | built-in | Server-side validation |
| **File Storage** | Laravel Storage (local/S3) | built-in | Product images |
| **Admin** | Custom (API-driven) | — | Admin panel via React |
| **Deployment** | Vercel (frontend) + Forge/VPS (backend) | — | Hosting |

### Why This Stack?

- **Laravel**: Ecosystem matang (Eloquent, migrations, scheduling, Sanctum auth, form requests)
- **Next.js App Router**: SEO-friendly SSR, route groups, layouts, server components
- **Sanctum**: Simple token auth untuk SPA, tanpa kompleksitas OAuth/Passport
- **MySQL**: Relational data (products, orders, users) — natural fit untuk rental system
- **Zustand**: Lightweight, persistent cart state tanpa Redux boilerplate

