### Layered Architecture Detail

```
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│  ROUTES (routes/api.php)                                  │
│  Defines URL + HTTP method + middleware + controller      │
│  Route::post('/rentals/checkout', [RentalController,      │
│              'checkout'])->middleware('auth:sanctum');     │
└───────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────┘
                        │
┌───────────────────────▼──────────────────────────────────┐
│  FORM REQUEST (Requests/Rental/CheckoutRequest.php)       │
│  Validates request body BEFORE reaching controller        │
│  rules(): ['rental_start' => 'required|date|after:today'] │
│  authorize(): return auth()->check()                      │
└───────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────┘
                        │
┌───────────────────────▼──────────────────────────────────┐
│  CONTROLLER (Controllers/Api/RentalController.php)        │
│  1. Receives validated request                            │
│  2. Calls service method                                  │
│  3. Returns JSON response (via ApiResponseTrait)          │
│  Does NOT contain business logic!                         │
└───────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────┘
                        │
┌───────────────────────▼──────────────────────────────────┐
│  SERVICE (Services/RentalService.php)                     │
│  ALL business logic lives here:                           │
│  1. Check stock availability for date range               │
│  2. Calculate total price                                 │
│  3. Create rental + rental_items records                   │
│  4. Deduct stock temporarily                              │
│  5. Clear user's cart                                     │
│  6. Send notification                                     │
└───────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────┘
                        │
┌───────────────────────▼──────────────────────────────────┐
│  MODEL (Models/Rental.php via Eloquent)                    │
│  Defines relationships, scopes, casts, accessors           │
│  belongsTo(User), hasMany(RentalItem), hasOne(Payment)    │
└───────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────┘
                        │
┌───────────────────────▼──────────────────────────────────┐
│  DATABASE (MySQL)                                         │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

