## 18. Middleware Stack

### Laravel Middleware

| Middleware | Applied To | Purpose |
|-----------|-----------|---------|
| `auth:sanctum` | All `/cart`, `/rentals`, `/users`, `/payments` | Verify Sanctum token |
| `ensure.is.admin` | All `/admin/*` | Check `user.role === 'admin'` |
| `ensure.has.address` | `POST /rentals/checkout` | Block if user has no address |
| `ensure.store.open` | `POST /rentals/checkout` | Block if store is closed |
| `throttle:60,1` | All API routes | Rate limit 60 req/min |
| `throttle:5,1` | Auth routes | Rate limit 5 req/min for login/register |

