## 19. Scheduled Tasks & Cron Jobs

```php
// app/Console/Kernel.php → schedule()
$schedule->command('rentals:auto-cancel-unpaid')->hourly();
    // Cancel rentals yang pending_payment > 24 jam

$schedule->command('rentals:check-overdue')->dailyAt('01:00');
    // Mark rentals yang melewati rental_end sebagai overdue

$schedule->command('rentals:send-pickup-reminders')->dailyAt('08:00');
    // Kirim reminder ke user yang pickup H-1

$schedule->command('reports:daily')->dailyAt('23:00');
    // Generate laporan harian admin (total rental, revenue)
```

