## 21. Naming Conventions

| Category | Convention | Example |
|----------|-----------|---------|
| **Laravel Models** | PascalCase singular | `Rental.php`, `CartItem.php` |
| **Laravel Controllers** | PascalCase + Controller | `RentalController.php` |
| **Laravel Migrations** | snake_case with verb | `create_rentals_table.php` |
| **Laravel Form Requests** | PascalCase + Request | `CheckoutRequest.php` |
| **Laravel Services** | PascalCase + Service | `RentalService.php` |
| **Laravel Enums** | PascalCase | `RentalStatus.php` |
| **API Routes** | kebab-case plural | `/api/cart/items`, `/api/rentals` |
| **Next.js Pages** | `page.tsx` in folder | `products/[slug]/page.tsx` |
| **React Components** | PascalCase.tsx | `ProductCard.tsx` |
| **Hooks** | use + camelCase | `useCart.ts` |
| **Services (FE)** | kebab.service.ts | `rental.service.ts` |
| **Types (FE)** | kebab.types.ts | `rental.types.ts` |
| **Stores** | use + PascalCase + Store | `useCartStore.ts` |
| **DB Columns** | snake_case | `price_per_day`, `rental_start` |

---

> **Dokumen ini adalah blueprint lengkap untuk Matterhorn.co.** Berikan ke LLM lain sebagai konteks awal, dan mereka akan bisa membangun platform ini dari nol dengan arsitektur yang solid dan konsisten.
